 that is happening now </li> \t<li>something that is happening around now </li>  </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I love it here in Amsterdam!<br />  Spend the evening on the deck of a canal boat.<br />   What music do you enjoy?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where am I going next?<br /> I'm considering China, Russia and Turkey!<br />  I am packing my suitcase tonight.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We're traveling through the canals in Amsterdam. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I want to visit some friends."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le10ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Zero Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the zero conditional to talk about general truths."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are two parts to the sentence.<br />One part is the condition. The other part is the result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"><br />If  or When + the Simple Present, the Simple Present tense  </span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Condition </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Result </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you want to see tulips,<br />  If you like opera,<br />  When you win a lottery,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">this is the place to come.<br />  Salzburg has great performances.<br />  traveling is a joy! \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "canal "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a channel of water made for boats "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many canals in Amsterdam."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tulip "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a bell shaped flower from a bulb "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  If you want to see tulips, this is the place to come. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "houseboat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a home on the water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some people in Amsterdam live on houseboats."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "performance "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a presentation in a theater "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her performance in the opera is amazing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "soloist "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person who sings or plays alone  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The soloist had a beautiful voice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look your best "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look as good as you can "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's her first date with Tom and she want to look her best."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "complete "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "whole; entire "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to book the complete package."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deck "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a floor between the sides of a ship or boat  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can sit on the deck of the boat and look at the city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner what things you miss about home when you are on vacation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what you do when you return home."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say where you go and who you see."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5-7 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I miss when I'm away."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express wishes and possibilities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements on my intentions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my statements to my partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "co